## Features

- Full coverage of all X API v2 endpoint groups with Pydantic v2 models
- Bearer Token, OAuth 2.0 PKCE (confidential & public clients with automatic token refresh), and OAuth 1.0a RFC 5849 signing
- Automatic cursor pagination (`Iterator` pages + `Cursor(...).items()` / `.pages()`)
- Resilient chunked NDJSON streaming with incremental UTF-8 decoding and exponential backoff reconnect
- Optional default `timeout` and `429 Retry-After` / `5xx` transient retry support

